      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The frequency of HAV and HEV infections and their cytokine profiles were analyzed in Mexican pediatric patients with acute hepatitis. A high frequency of co-infections was found. Significant overexpression of IL-4, IL-12, IL-13 and IFN-gamma during HAV mono-infections and limited secretion of cytokines in HEV infections were observed."},
